  "content": "\n\n<p>這是一個原版狼的材質包，改變了狼的外觀，讓它們看起來稍微更好看！<br><br>（需要 OptiFine）<br><br><br>（狼眼變體）&nbsp;<img src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/f81c36c8-f9ff-4391-ace2-c9c03f2f9f65/dkfaji9-0b4ef589-af0b-4042-ada8-5aca6585f58f.png?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..PqL0bBhlZePq6-VpZcqIf_YxZNrNfkwdxw4QPLfP3-A\" alt=\"Wolf Close up for eyes\"><br><br><img src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/f81c36c8-f9ff-4391-ace2-c9c03f2f9f65/dkfaji9-b8326309-5f3b-4813-905e-63a8ab84ecb2.png?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..I1_9ML9H1N6a8F9CVv1XnqKr1CjCnkIhtAvu-m-ZJs0\" alt=\"Tame wolf texture \"><br><br><img src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/f81c36c8-f9ff-4391-ace2-c9c03f2f9f65/dkfaji9-90c6370d-6209-47ed-9b9e-a308d8054e0e.png?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..KRsxBjGOnVCKf2J01JVTd9als_wm134bhC-_eHG4HAo\" alt=\"Mad Wolf Texture \"><br><br><br><br><br>非常感謝同志&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fsuper_jose%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Super_Jose</a>&nbsp;教導我材質製作的技巧！:DDD<br><br>快去查看他的個人檔案並給予他大量的訂閱與留言吧！:DDD<br><br>這可不是什麼建議……</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>更多圖片 <img src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/texture-pack/2025/697/19113313-wolf_xl.webp\"><img src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/texture-pack/2025/697/19113314-wolf_xl.webp\"><img src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/texture-pack/2025/697/19113315-wolf_xl.webp\"><img src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/texture-pack/2025/697/19113316-wolf_xl.webp\"><img src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/texture-pack/2025/697/19113317-wolf_xl.webp\"><img src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/texture-pack/2025/697/19113318-wolf_xl.webp\"><img src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/texture-pack/2025/697/19113319-wolf_xl.webp\"><img src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/texture-pack/2025/697/19113320-wolf_xl.webp\"><img src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/texture-pack/2025/697/19113321-wolf_xl.webp\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>更多<br><br><br>（已知問題）狼甲可能會有點滑稽，但大致上沒問題！:D</p>",
